WEBVTT

00:02:59.515 --> 00:03:02.060
BG: Pa,odlučili smo da odaberemo dva

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:04.920
bilo koja najveća globalna problema,

00:03:04.920 --> 00:03:07.180
a to su bila deca koja umiru,

00:03:07.180 --> 00:03:09.920
deca nerazvijena zbog nedovoljne ishrane,

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:11.419
i zemlje u problemu

00:03:11.419 --> 00:03:13.679
zbog velike smrtnosti,

00:03:13.679 --> 00:03:15.647
a roditelji su imali toliko dece

00:03:15.647 --> 00:03:17.165
da je broj stanovništva rastao

00:03:17.165 --> 00:03:20.291
a deca bivala toliko bolesna

00:03:20.291 --> 00:03:22.937
da nisu mogla da se obrazuju

00:03:22.937 --> 00:03:24.809
i napreduju.

00:03:24.809 --> 00:03:25.917
To je globalno,

00:03:25.917 --> 00:03:28.637
a opet, ovde u Americi,

00:03:28.637 --> 00:03:31.411
oboje smo imali odlično obrazovanje